# This workspace is saas's own composition: it composes no module behind a hop,
# so the gateway stands none here (code/gateway_hop.go reads an empty MODULES as
# "stand no hop") and no module has a hop to dial (an empty ENDPOINT).
#
# Codefly offers a composed module's repository-root configurations to every
# workspace that composes it, beside its module directory, so this file is also
# the hop group saas ships. A composing workspace's own hop group is overlaid on
# it per key and may only set keys declared here. So it declares every key a
# composition's hop group carries, each with an empty value that a composition
# replaces with its own: MODULES (the modules the hop fronts), ENDPOINT (where
# modules dial the hop) and ENFORCEMENT (the gateway's hop reads it; empty is
# enforce). An address is never written here; the composition names its hop.
MODULES=
ENDPOINT=
ENFORCEMENT=
